5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's the first day, we have no information.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let's try to find the werewolf together, gently.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We should look for contradictions in our statements as the game progresses.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach is best. I shall be observing the flow of conversation quite closely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,This is so exciting! I'll do my best to help everyone find the bad guy!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,Does anyone have a specific strategy they want to propose for the first few days?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,I think we should just listen to each other and be kind.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Kindness is good, but we must remain vigilant. The werewolf is among us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I wonder who among us is hiding their true nature behind a smile.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
