31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We have no deaths yet, but we must vote today. Any suspicions?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it's hard to suspect anyone when everyone is so lovely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Shizue-san, you're being very vague. That could be a tactic to avoid scrutiny.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I have some very interesting information. I believe Shizue is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Shizue-san? No way, she's way too nice for that!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin, are you claiming to be the Seer? That's a bold move on day one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, Benjamin-san, I'm quite hurt. I would never do such a thing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If Benjamin is the Seer, his information is absolute. We should consider it seriously.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am indeed the Seer. My divination of Shizue was quite clear.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,But maybe he's lying to trick us? We can't just trust one person!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"If Benjamin is the werewolf, he's trying to frame Shizue. If he's the Seer, she's the wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I only wish for us all to get along. I am just a simple old woman.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,The logic favors Benjamin's claim for now. It's a high-risk play for a werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. Why would I reveal my role so early if I were the enemy?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I don't know... this is confusing! I want to believe Shizue-san!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,I trust Benjamin's logic. I will vote for Shizue.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I'm sorry it has come to this.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. The evidence provided by the Seer is the only lead we have.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I trust my own eyes. Shizue is the wolf.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll go with the group, but I'm still not sure!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
